The tour (Resources/Tour) contains:

- Official specimen images, not real people's documents, shown unaltered with level rectangular
  masks made by MaskCopy's engine (`maske tour`) and reviewed by hand:
  - United States passport, Next Generation data page, U.S. Department of State, public domain
    (https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:United_States_Next_Generation_Passport_signature_and_biodata_page.jpg)
  - Norwegian passport 2026 data page, from "Control Guide for Norwegian Passports, Version 2026",
    Politiet (Norwegian Police) (https://www.politiet.no/)
  - Chinese passport 2018 data page, National Immigration Administration of the People's Republic of
    China, public domain (https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chinese_passport_2018-09-29.png)
  - California driver licence sample, public domain
    (https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Californian_sample_driver%27s_license,_c._2019.jpg)
  - Dutch passport 2021 data page, from "Features of Dutch passports 2021", Rijksdienst voor
    Identiteitsgegevens (RvIG) (https://www.rvig.nl/)
- A dotted globe generated by scripts/globe.py from Natural Earth 1:110m countries, public domain
  (https://www.naturalearthdata.com).
